<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Hermes Easy Installer - Windows</title>
  <hta:application
    id="HermesEasyInstaller"
    applicationname="Hermes Easy Installer"
    border="thin"
    caption="yes"
    maximizebutton="yes"
    minimizebutton="yes"
    scroll="yes"
    singleinstance="yes"
    sysmenu="yes"
    windowstate="normal">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #08111f;
      color: #eef4ff;
    }
    main {
      width: 860px;
      max-width: calc(100% - 48px);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 34px 0 44px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 42px;
      line-height: 1.08;
    }
    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    p, li {
      color: #c8d6ee;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .panel {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #2b3955;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #111a2b;
    }
    button {
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border: 1px solid #7dd3fc;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #12314a;
      color: #eefaff;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    button.secondary {
      border-color: #2b3955;
      background: #0f1b2e;
    }
    .actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }
    .status {
      margin-top: 14px;
      color: #86efac;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .brand-mark {
      margin-top: 22px;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid #2b3955;
      color: #c8d6ee;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .brand-mark strong {
      color: #eef4ff;
    }
    code {
      color: #f8d87a;
      background: #050a13;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
  </style>
  <script>
    function shell() {
      return new ActiveXObject("WScript.Shell");
    }

    function runInstaller() {
      var sh = shell();
      var path = document.location.pathname;
      path = decodeURIComponent(path);
      if (path.charAt(0) === "/" && path.charAt(2) === ":") path = path.substring(1);
      path = path.replace(/\//g, "\\");
      var folder = path.substring(0, path.lastIndexOf("\\"));
      var bat = folder + "\\instalar-windows-direto.bat";
      sh.Run('"' + bat + '"', 1, false);
      document.getElementById("status").innerText = "Instalador aberto. Siga a janela do PowerShell.";
    }

    function openDocs() {
      var sh = shell();
      var path = document.location.pathname;
      path = decodeURIComponent(path);
      if (path.charAt(0) === "/" && path.charAt(2) === ":") path = path.substring(1);
      path = path.replace(/\//g, "\\");
      var folder = path.substring(0, path.lastIndexOf("\\"));
      var docs = folder + "\\..\\Documentacao\\COMECE_AQUI.html";
      sh.Run('"' + docs + '"', 1, false);
    }
  </script>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Hermes Easy Installer</h1>
    <p>Este é o modo Windows nativo. Aqui o botão executa o instalador de verdade, sem depender do navegador abrir arquivos <code>.bat</code>.</p>

    <div class="panel">
      <h2>1. Instalar Hermes Agent</h2>
      <p>Clique no botão abaixo. Uma janela do PowerShell vai abrir e baixar o instalador oficial mais recente do Hermes Agent.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <button onclick="runInstaller()">Instalar Hermes no Windows</button>
        <button class="secondary" onclick="openDocs()">Abrir guia</button>
      </div>
      <div class="status" id="status"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h2>2. Depois da instalação</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Abra um PowerShell novo.</li>
        <li>Rode <code>hermes</code> para testar.</li>
        <li>Se precisar configurar modelo/API key, rode <code>hermes model</code>.</li>
        <li>Para Telegram, rode <code>hermes gateway setup</code> e siga o guia.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <p class="brand-mark">Desenvolvido por <strong>Daniel Moreira</strong> · Instagram <strong>@moreiraprodux</strong></p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
